, you know, have no plans to take price the rest of the year and have taken minimal price increases year over year to put forward a really great value proposition for our guests regardless of what the macroeconomic conditions bring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/15/cava-group-cava-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAVA 2023 Q3","e":"cava","d":"2023-11-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tricia Tolivar","x":"First, regarding pricing, we expect to return to our historical price increases of 2.5% to 3% starting in January.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/11/07/cava-group-cava-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAVA 2023 Q3","e":"cava","d":"2023-11-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Brett Schulman","x":"So, we have been leaning into our value proposition, Tricia talked about the price increases or the lack thereof that we've taken compared to many peers working on behalf of our guests trying to drive a great value proposition for them when they're feeling the pressures of inflation from other…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/11/07/cava-group-cava-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAVA 2023 Q4","e":"cava","d":"2024-02-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Brett Schulman","x":"We are working on behalf of our guests by mitigating price increases and by not taking outsized pricing to offset unplanned costs related to the impact of new legislation, like AB 1228 in California, which includes aspects of its predecessor bill known as the FAST Act.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/27/cava-group-cava-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAVA 2023 Q4","e":"cava","d":"2024-02-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tricia Tolivar","x":"As you know, we took an approximate 3% in-restaurant menu price increase in January 2024.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/27/cava-group-cava-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAVA 2023 Q4","e":"cava","d":"2024-02-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brett Schulman","x":"We believe that this work, combined with a focus on streamlining and automating prep, as well as leveraging AI technologies to improve forecasting and accuracy through our new connected kitchen initiative, will make our restaurants easier to operate, drive improved operational efficiency and…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/27/cava-group-cava-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAVA 2024 Q1","e":"cava","d":"2024-05-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tricia Tolivar","x":"So, in fact, we raised our guidance and the low end of the range is 200 basis points higher than what we reported in the first quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/28/cava-group-cava-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAVA 2024 Q2","e":"cava","d":"2024-08-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Brett Schulman","x":"In this post high inflationary environment, traditional full-service chains are struggling to deliver a compelling value proposition while conventional fast food chains have raised prices at a faster rate, driving the perception that they have become too expensive.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/23/cava-group-cava-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAVA 2024 Q2","e":"cava","d":"2024-08-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Brett Schulman","x":"One example of this is in California, where we did not take incremental price increases in response to AB 1228.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/23/cava-group-cava-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAVA 2024 Q2","e":"cava","d":"2024-08-22","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tricia Tolivar","x":"As a result, we have a more front half weighted opening schedule while still raising our full year guidance and avoiding opening restaurants during the busy holiday season.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/23/cava-group-cava-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAVA 2024 Q3","e":"cava","d":"2024-11-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Tricia Tolivar","x":"This increase reflects investments in our team member wages of 8%, including the impact from AB 1228, which we chose not to offset with the menu price increase to the guest, partially offset by leverage from increased sales compared to the prior year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/12/cava-group-cava-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAVA 2024 Q3","e":"cava","d":"2024-11-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Tricia Tolivar","x":"And then, when you look at price/mix combined, mix was about -- excuse me.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/12/cava-group-cava-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAVA 2024 Q4","e":"cava","d":"2025-02-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tricia Tolivar","x":"This decrease reflects leverage from increased sales, partially offset by investments in our team member wages up 4%, including the impact of AB 1228, which we chose to not offset with menu price increases to the guests.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/25/cava-group-cava-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAVA 2024 Q4","e":"cava","d":"2025-02-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tricia Tolivar","x":"And at this time, we have no plans for further price increases this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/25/cava-group-cava-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAVA 2025 Q1","e":"cava","d":"2025-05-15","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Tricia Tolivar","x":"We remain vigilant in monitoring our supply chain, including any potential impact related to tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/16/cava-cava-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAVA 2025 Q1","e":"cava","d":"2025-05-15","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tricia Tolivar","x":"And then also being very thoughtful in mind menu price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/16/cava-cava-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAVA 2025 Q1","e":"cava","d":"2025-05-15","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tricia Tolivar","x":"So keep in mind, our combined impact for pricing mix includes 1.7% for menu price increases, which still delivers a fairly healthy mix impact.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/16/cava-cava-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAVA 2025 Q3","e":"cava","d":"2025-11-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Tricia Tolivar","x":"This slight increase reflects the impact of tariffs and our limited-time-only chicken shawarma offering.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/cava-group-cava-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAVA 2025 Q3","e":"cava","d":"2025-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tricia Tolivar","x":"So our expectation is our price increase will be very modest and less than what we did in 2025.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/cava-group-cava-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAVA 2025 Q3","e":"cava","d":"2025-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Brett Schulman","x":"During that same time frame, we have worked relentlessly to make our food more accessible to guests, underpricing CPI by almost 10% while taking less than half the aggregate 34% price increases of industry peers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/cava-group-cava-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAVA 2026 Q1","e":"cava","d":"2026-05-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Brett Schulman","x":"This past January, we took an approximate 1.4% price increase price increase, while holding baseball and PETA pricing flat.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/19/cava-cava-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAVA 2026 Q1","e":"cava","d":"2026-05-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Brett Schulman","x":"And continuing our operational execution while mitigating menu price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/19/cava-cava-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAVA 2026 Q1","e":"cava","d":"2026-05-19","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tricia K. Tolivar","x":"We are raising our guidance to expect the following.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/19/cava-cava-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAVA 2026 Q1","e":"cava","d":"2026-05-19","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tricia K. Tolivar","x":"We increased our full year outlook to 4.5% to 6.5% growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/19/cava-cava-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAVA 2026 Q2","e":"cava","d":"2026-08-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tricia Tolivar","x":"So really demonstrating the white space opportunity that we have and certainly, the investments that we're making in minimizing our price increases is translating into greater accessibility for many across the country.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/18/cava-cava-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAVA 2026 Q2","e":"cava","d":"2026-08-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Brett Schulman","x":"…in our business, Tricia talked about investments in our team members, investments in things like pre-marinated chicken to make our operations easier for our team or invest in our guests underpricing inflation, mitigating those menu price increases that we've seen from many others in the industry.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/18/cava-cava-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAVA 2026 Q2","e":"cava","d":"2026-08-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Dani